/ActualText (Indian Navy / INICAI \023 AI Projects\(Designed AI interfaces, dashboards, workflows, and information-heavy applications for online and fully offline environments.\nNorwood Charity\(Redesigned donation flow and navigation to create a simpler user experience.\nGS Fresh Web App\(Designed e-commerce flows focused on product discovery, shopping, and responsive UI.\nPIMS \(Talkback\)\(Designed dashboards and workflows with clear information hierarchy and simpler task flows.\nRusticgram\(Designed a responsive social platform with clean navigation and reusable UI components.\nPassionPro\(Designed task-based dashboards with simple navigation and easy-to-understand interfaces.)
